1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
The wheel is straight. The car isn't.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
A pull like this has more than one cause.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Only pulls when you brake?
That can point to the brakes.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Pulls all the time? That can point
to alignment — or just tire pressure.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Check pressure first. It's free,
and it's often the answer.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Changing pull, worth checking soon.
Steady and mild can wait — but do not guess.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before it becomes a bigger fix.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Send this before you book anything.
Stop by — we'll check pressure and take a look, free.
